---
import Base from '@/layouts/Base.astro'
---
<Base title="Sources · RoboWiki" description="Source tiers and first-party references.">
  <article class="prose mx-auto max-w-3xl py-6">
    <h1>Sources</h1>
    <p>The only test for a number to enter the catalog: <strong>can it be traced back to a first-party source?</strong></p>
    <ul>
      <li><code>A</code> — cross-checked against the vendor manual / official document</li>
      <li><code>B</code> — public product page or third-party compilation, not cross-checked</li>
      <li><code>C</code> — relayed, lead only</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Vendor sites and official docs</h2>
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>Source</th><th>Type</th><th>Covers</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>DAMIAO</td><td>Vendor site</td><td>Joint motors, controller boards</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Lingzu RobStride</td><td>Vendor site + PDF specs</td><td>Joint motors</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Unitree</td><td>Vendor site</td><td>Motors, 4D LiDAR</td></tr>
        <tr><td>DJI RoboMaster</td><td>Vendor site + user manuals</td><td>Boards, motors, ESCs</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Orbbec</td><td>Vendor site</td><td>Depth cameras</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Livox</td><td>Vendor site</td><td>LiDAR</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Intel RealSense (regional distributor)</td><td>Distributor site</td><td>Depth cameras</td></tr>
        <tr><td>NVIDIA Jetson</td><td>Vendor site</td><td>Compute modules</td></tr>
        <tr><td>D-Robotics RDK docs</td><td>Official docs</td><td>Edge computers</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <p>Every part row carries <code>source_tier</code>, <code>origin</code> and <code>last_checked</code>.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
